{"ts": 1791258915.378309, "type": "step", "step": 26, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I added a usable eval paragraph to your writeup. One more fix: your environment section should include observations and mention partial observability. You can write: \u201cEnvironment: the state includes files and calendar; observations are the currently visible screen contents/messages; actions include opening resources and sending messages. The setup is partially observable because the assistant only sees part of the student/computer state unless it opens files or channels.\u201d If you want, I can add that wording directly too.", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "week3-environment"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\n[activity] t=7 messages 1m", "t": 8, "activity": [{"t": 7, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.29115493346610727, "pass_k": 0.45874216847287114}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.75, "pass_k": 0.75}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8418151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.6164404438934201, "persistence": 0.3421403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.7731, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258917.576152, "type": "step", "step": 27, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\nSuggested environment text:\nEnvironment: the underlying state includes the student\u2019s files, calendar, messages, and other relevant computer/task context. Observations are whatever is currently visible on screen plus any files, channels, or pages the assistant opens. Actions include opening files/pages, reading channels, sending messages, scheduling blocks, and running quizzes. This environment is partially observable because the assistant cannot see the full state unless it actively gathers information.\n"}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 8, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.29115493346610727, "pass_k": 0.45874216847287114}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.75, "pass_k": 0.75}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8418151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.6164404438934201, "persistence": 0.3421403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.7731, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
