{"ts": 1791258920.4603, "type": "step", "step": 29, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Nice \u2014 you got 2/2 on pass^k. That means your eval concept is solid. To finish getting you ready for Friday, I\u2019m going to check one more concept: the environment definition, especially observations vs state and partial observability.", "intent": "nudge", "concept": "week3-environment"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\nStudent: I don't really get pomdp yet\n[activity] t=14 messages 1m", "t": 15, "activity": [{"t": 14, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.29115493346610727, "pass_k": 0.45874216847287114}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.75, "pass_k": 0.75}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8218151230937745, "motivation": 0.544715486329607, "reliance": 0.6164404438934201, "persistence": 0.3421403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9411699999999996, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258923.2273889, "type": "step", "step": 30, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "A POMDP just means the agent cannot see the full true state directly. In your case, the full state includes lots of things the assistant doesn\u2019t automatically know, like what files exist, what messages are unread, and the student\u2019s attention. It only gets partial observations, like what\u2019s on screen right now or what it sees after opening a file/channel. So the assistant has to act under uncertainty and gather information. Short version you can use: \u201cThis is a POMDP because the assistant observes only part of the underlying state and must take actions to reveal more.\u201d", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-environment"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=15 messages 4m", "t": 19, "activity": [{"t": 15, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.4123497970151408, "pass_k": 0.45874216847287114}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.75, "pass_k": 0.75}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8218151230937745, "motivation": 0.494715486329607, "reliance": 0.6164404438934201, "persistence": 0.3421403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.0588189999999997, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
